      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZAMBADA ICON (8) settled back from out wide but wound up hard into the minor money, finishing 5 lengths from the winner (24.11) at this track in Grade 5. Racing well and deserves a win. ULTIMO (5) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Good Odds Rocky (24.38) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature again. KUEBIKO (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (24.58) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. KARUNA (1) is always hard to beat when drawn in this box.",
